  "summary": "Flock Safety began removing its 25 ALPR cameras from Springfield, Oregon on Jan. 21, 2026, after the Springfield Police Department announced in December it was ending its contract following community protests over data-sharing concerns. The cameras had been off since installation except for an unauthorized activation on Nov. 7.",
